The code snippet below illustrates four concurrent warp-wide exclusive prefix max scans
within a block of 128 threads (one per each of the 32-thread warps).

.. code-block:: c++

   #include <cub/cub.cuh>

   __global__ void ExampleKernel(...)
   {
